atisfy coverage.\",\n      \"basis\": [\n        {\n          \"span_ref\": \"span-000006\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"finding_ids\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"docs/testing/story-2-5-controlled-acceptance/exclusive-resolution-v15.md\",\n      \"local_id\": \"40\",\n      \"decision\": \"represented\",\n      \"proposal_ids\": [\n        \"proposal:exclusive-resolution-v15-6\",\n        \"proposal:exclusive-resolution-v15-2\",\n        \"proposal:exclusive-resolution-v15-1\"\n      ],\n      \"reason\": \"The separate two-accept scenario combines with immutable Commit, MapReady finalization and exactly-once reward semantics.\",\n      \"basis\": [\n        {\n          \"span_ref\": \"span-000007\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"span_ref\": \"span-000003\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"span_ref\": \"span-000002\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"finding_ids\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"docs/testing/story-2-5-controlled-acceptance/exclusive-resolution-v15.md\",\n      \"local_id\": \"41\",\n      \"decision\": \"represented\",\n      \"proposal_ids\": [\n        \"proposal:exclusive-resolution-v15-6\",\n        \"proposal:exclusive-resolution-v15-2\",\n        \"proposal:exclusive-resolution-v15-1\"\n      ],\n      \"reason\": \"The separate two-cancel scenario preserves Cancel and MapCancelled throughout, with no grant.\",\n      \"basis\": [\n        {\n          \"span_ref\": \"span-000007\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"span_ref\": \"span-000003\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"span_ref\": \"span-000002\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"finding_ids\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"docs/testing/story-2-5-controlled-acceptance/exclusive-resolution-v15.md\",\n      \"local_id\": \"42\",\n      \"decision\": \"represented\",\n      \"proposal_ids\": [\n        \"proposal:exclusive-resolution-v15-6\",\n        \"proposal:exclusive-resolution-v15-2\"\n      ],\n      \"reason\": \"The separate accept-then-cancel scenario explicitly preserves Commit and MapReady without reversing the grant.\",\n      \"basis\": [\n        {\n          \"span_ref\": \"span-000007\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"span_ref\": \"span-000003\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"finding_ids\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"docs/testing/story-2-5-controlled-acceptance/exclusive-resolution-v15.md\",\n      \"local_id\": \"43\",\n      \"decision\": \"represented\",\n      \"proposal_ids\": [\n        \"proposal:exclusive-resolution-v15-6\",\n        \"proposal:exclusive-resolution-v15-2\"\n      ],\n      \"reason\": \"The separate cancel-then-accept scenario explicitly preserves Cancel and MapCancelled without granting.\",\n      \"basis\": [\n        {\n          \"span_ref\": \"span-000007\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"span_ref\": \"span-000003\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"finding_ids\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"docs/testing/story-2-5-controlled-acceptance/exclusive-resolution-v15.md\",\n      \"local_id\": \"44\",\n      \"decision\": \"represented\",\n      \"proposal_ids\": [\n        \"proposal:exclusive-resolution-v15-6\",\n        \"proposal:exclusive-resolution-v15-2\",\n        \"proposal:exclusive-resolution-v15-4\"\n      ],\n      \"reason\": \"The separate empty-resume scenario retains no write, Idle finalization and ordinary completion and observation checks.\",\n      \"basis\": [\n        {\n          \"span_ref\": \"span-000007\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"span_ref\": \"span-000003\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"span_ref\": \"span-000005\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"finding_ids\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"docs/testing/story-2-5-controlled-acceptance/exclusive-resolution-v15.md\",\n      \"local_id\": \"45\",\n      \"decision\": \"represented\",\n      \"proposal_ids\": [\n        \"proposal:exclusive-resolution-v15-6\",\n        \"proposal:exclusive-resolution-v15-2\",\n        \"proposal:exclusive-resolution-v15-1\"\n      ],\n      \"reason\": \"The separate successful-accept restart scenario requires resume from unchanged Commit to MapReady without repeating grant or logical return.\",\n      \"basis\": [\n        {\n          \"span_ref\": \"span-000007\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"span_ref\": \"span-000003\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"span_ref\": \"span-000002\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"finding_ids\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"docs/testing/story-2-5-controlled-acceptance/exclusive-resolution-v15.md\",\n      \"local_id\": \"46\",\n      \"decision\": \"represented\",\n      \"proposal_ids\": [\n        \"proposal:exclusive-resolution-v15-6\",\n        \"proposal:exclusive-resolution-v15-2\",\n        \"proposal:exclusive-resolution-v15-1\"\n      ],\n      \"reason\": \"The separate successful-cancel restart scenario requires restoration of Cancel and MapCancelled without repeating a decision or logical return.\",\n      \"basis\": [\n        {\n          \"span_ref\": \"span-000007\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"span_ref\": \"span-000003\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"span_ref\": \"span-000002\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"finding_ids\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"docs/testing/story-2-5-controlled-acceptance/exclusive-resolution-v15.md\",\n      \"local_id\": \"47\",\n      \"decision\": \"represented\",\n      \"proposal_ids\": [\n        \"proposal:exclusive-resolution-v15-6\",\n        \"proposal:exclusive-resolution-v15-5\",\n        \"proposal:exclusive-resolution-v15-4\",\n        \"proposal:exclusive-resolution-v15-2\"\n      ],\n      \"reason\": \"Accept-before is a separate fresh-J scenario with the specified hook, empty retained journal, zero interrupted-call completions and ordinary recovery resume to Idle.\",\n      \"basis\": [\n        {\n          \"span_ref\": \"span-000007\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"span_ref\": \"span-000006\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"span_ref\": \"span-000005\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"span_ref\": \"span-000003\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"finding_ids\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"docs/testing/story-2-5-controlled-acceptance/exclusive-resolution-v15.md\",\n      \"local_id\": \"48\",\n      \"decision\": \"represented\",\n      \"proposal_ids\": [\n        \"proposal:exclusive-resolution-v15-6\",\n        \"proposal:exclusive-resolution-v15-5\",\n        \"proposal:exclusive-resolution-v15-4\",\n        \"proposal:exclusive-resolution-v15-2\",\n        \"proposal:exclusive-resolution-v15-1\"\n      ],\n      \"reason\": \"Accept-after retains Commit with zero interrupted-call completions; recovery restores MapReady without another grant or logical return.\",\n      \"basis\": [\n        {\n          \"span_ref\": \"span-000007\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"span_ref\": \"span-000006\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"span_ref\": \"span-000005\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"span_ref\": \"span-000003\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"span_ref\": \"span-000002\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"finding_ids\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"docs/testing/story-2-5-controlled-acceptance/exclusive-resolution-v15.md\",\n      \"local_id\": \"49\",\n      \"decision\": \"represented\",\n      \"proposal_ids\": [\n        \"proposal:exclusive-resolution-v15-6\",\n        \"proposal:exclusive-resolution-v15-5\",\n        \"proposal:exclusive-resolution-v15-4\",\n        \"proposal:exclusive-resolution-v15-2\"\n      ],\n      \"reason\": \"Cancel-before is a separate fresh-J scenario with the specified hook, empty retained journal, zero interrupted-call completions and ordinary recovery resume to Idle.\",\n      \"basis\": [\n        {\n          \"span_ref\": \"span-000007\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"span_ref\": \"span-000006\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"span_ref\": \"span-000005\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"span_ref\": \"span-000003\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"finding_ids\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"docs/testing/story-2-5-controlled-acceptance/exclusive-resolution-v15.md\",\n      \"local_id\": \"50\",\n      \"decision\": \"represented\",\n      \"proposal_ids\": [\n        \"proposal:exclusive-resolution-v15-6\",\n        \"proposal:exclusive-resolution-v15-5\",\n        \"proposal:exclusive-resolution-v15-4\",\n        \"proposal:exclusive-resolution-v15-2\",\n        \"proposal:exclusive-resolution-v15-1\"\n      ],\n      \"reason\": \"Cancel-after retains Cancel with zero interrupted-call completions; recovery restores MapCancelled without granting or repeating cancellation or logical return.\",\n      \"basis\": [\n        {\n          \"span_ref\": \"span-000007\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"span_ref\": \"span-000006\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"span_ref\": \"span-000005\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"span_ref\": \"span-000003\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"span_ref\": \"span-000002\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"finding_ids\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"docs/testing/story-2-5-controlled-acceptance/exclusive-resolution-v15.md\",\n      \"local_id\": \"51\",\n      \"decision\": \"represented\",\n      \"proposal_ids\": [\n        \"proposal:exclusive-resolution-v15-6\"\n      ],\n      \"reason\": \"Ordinary restart remains gated on successful observations and follows shutdown, confirmed exit/EOF, confirmed startup and resume, distinct from injected crashes.\",\n      \"basis\": [\n        {\n          \"span_ref\": \"span-000007\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"finding_ids\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"docs/testing/story-2-5-controlled-acceptance/exclusive-resolution-v15.md\",\n      \"local_id\": \"52\",\n      \"decision\": \"represented\",\n      \"proposal_ids\": [\n        \"proposal:exclusive-resolution-v15-6\",\n        \"proposal:exclusive-resolution-v15-4\"\n      ],\n      \"reason\": \"Earlier non-crashing completion-count obligations explicitly survive restart and remain subject to retained EOF auditing.\",\n      \"basis\": [\n        {\n          \"span_ref\": \"span-000007\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"span_ref\": \"span-000005\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"finding_ids\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"docs/testing/story-2-5-controlled-acceptance/exclusive-resolution-v15.md\",\n      \"local_id\": \"53\",\n      \"decision\": \"represented\",\n      \"proposal_ids\": [\n        \"proposal:exclusive-resolution-v15-6\",\n        \"proposal:exclusive-resolution-v15-2\",\n        \"proposal:exclusive-resolution-v15-1\"\n      ],\n      \"reason\": \"Every scenario step must follow the preceding journal/UI rules, including permanent cancellation and irreversible grants.\",\n      \"basis\": [\n        {\n          \"span_ref\": \"span-000007\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"span_ref\": \"span-000003\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"span_ref\": \"span-000002\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"finding_ids\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"docs/testing/story-2-5-controlled-acceptance/exclusive-resolution-v15.md\",\n      \"local_id\": \"54\",\n      \"decision\": \"represented\",\n      \"proposal_ids\": [\n        \"proposal:exclusive-resolution-v15-6\"\n      ],\n      \"reason\": \"Statement and acceptance intent explicitly prohibit treating flow planning as scenario execution.\",\n      \"basis\": [\n        {\n          \"span_ref\": \"span-000007\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"finding_ids\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"docs/testing/story-2-5-controlled-acceptance/exclusive-resolution-v15.md\",\n      \"local_id\": \"55\",\n      \"decision\": \"represented\",\n      \"proposal_ids\": [\n        \"proposal:exclusive-resolution-v15-7\"\n      ],\n      \"reason\": \"Synthetic adapters are explicitly required implementation work, without any assertion that executable endpoints already exist.\",\n      \"basis\": [\n        {\n          \"span_ref\": \"span-000008\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"finding_ids\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"docs/testing/story-2-5-controlled-acceptance/exclusive-resolution-v15.md\",\n      \"local_id\": \"56\",\n      \"decision\": \"represented\",\n      \"proposal_ids\": [\n        \"proposal:exclusive-resolution-v15-7\"\n      ],\n      \"reason\": \"The reward-controller implementer owns the explicit downstream handoff to select and document one shared versioned profile, including hook acknowledgement representation and return path.\",\n      \"basis\": [\n        {\n          \"span_ref\": \"span-000008\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"finding_ids\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"docs/testing/story-2-5-controlled-acceptance/exclusive-resolution-v15.md\",\n      \"local_id\": \"57\",\n      \"decision\": \"represented\",\n      \"proposal_ids\": [\n        \"proposal:exclusive-resolution-v15-7\"\n      ],\n      \"reason\": \"Encoding and argument spelling remain permitted design choices, while the downstream plan must resolve its selected profile. This bounded delegation does not leave the semantic proposal incomplete.\",\n      \"basis\": [\n        {\n          \"span_ref\": \"span-000008\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"finding_ids\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"docs/testing/story-2-5-controlled-acceptance/exclusive-resolution-v15.md\",\n      \"local_id\": \"58\",\n      \"decision\": \"represented\",\n      \"proposal_ids\": [\n        \"proposal:exclusive-resolution-v15-7\"\n      ],\n      \"reason\": \"Every permitted profile must preserve all listed identities, distinctions, ordering, barriers, independent observations, retained counts, deadlines and scenarios.\",\n      \"basis\": [\n        {\n          \"span_ref\": \"span-000008\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"finding_ids\": []\n    }\n  ],\n  \"findings\": []\n}","phase":"final_answer","memoryCitation":null,"delivery":null,"questions":null},"threadId":"01a1cfaa-cada-7523-82b7-0e1b0bce4604","turnId":"01a1cfaa-cb02-7b21-a775-4bcbaad04481","completedAtMs":1794485630029},"emittedAtMs":1794485630029}}
